WEBVTT

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:32.396
and there was a lot of things
that we didn't know,

00:11:32.436 --> 00:11:35.556
we certainly would have done
things differently.

00:11:35.916 --> 00:11:39.076
And that's why you have to be
humble and modest

00:11:39.116 --> 00:11:44.436
to realize if you are going
to be following the science,

00:11:44.436 --> 00:11:49.996
the science which gives you
data and information and evidence

00:11:49.996 --> 00:11:51.716
is going to change,

00:11:51.716 --> 00:11:55.556
particularly in the early phases
of the outbreak.

00:11:55.916 --> 00:11:59.956
Did we know how easily it was spread
from human to human?

00:11:59.996 --> 00:12:01.156
No.